  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HUDF/MDP Proc.expert</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HUDF/MDP upph.expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den svenska insatsen best&#xe5;r i att finansiera en upphandlingsexpert so skall bist&#xe5; den litauiska organisationen HUDF under implementeringen av Municipal Infrastructure Development Programme. Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; i utvecklandet av ett system av kommunala investeringar vad g&#xe4;ller infrastruktur och kommunala tj&#xe4;nster.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish contribution consists of financing of a procurement and disbursement specialist to HUDF in Lithuania during the implementatio of the Municipal Insfrastructure Development Programme. The aim of the programme is to assist in the development of a system of municipal investments in infrastructure and municipal services.</narrative>
  </description>
